OL,3,GNEWSAKing's statue close to getting    
OL,4,Amissing sceptre back                   
OL,6,FWork to replace a sceptre that vanished
OL,7,Ffrom a statue of King George III at a  
OL,8,Fseaside resort is reaching its final   
OL,9,Fstages.                                
OL,11,FThe monument to King George III was    
OL,12,Finstalled on Weymouth's Esplanade in   
OL,13,F1809 to mark the monarch's Golden      
OL,14,FJubilee.                               
OL,16,FThe 5ft-long (1.5m) staff, topped with 
OL,17,Fa cross, disappeared from the the      
OL,18,Fstatue's right hand over 50 years ago  
OL,19,Fand has never been recovered.          
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
