OL,3,GNEWSAKing's statue close to getting    
OL,4,Amissing sceptre back                   
OL,6,FThe statue has been covered in         
OL,7,Fscaffolding while the unicorn and the  
OL,8,Fking are repainted before the replica  
OL,9,Fsceptre, created from from hardwood and
OL,10,Fcoated in gold leaf, will return to the
OL,11,Fstone figure's right arm.              
